<view class="success-page">
  <view class="success-symbol">✓</view>
  <view class="success-title">资料已经收好</view>
  <view class="success-desc">你的资料已进入私密人工匹配池。出现初步合适的人选或需要核对资料时，我们才会联系。</view>
  <view class="success-actions dl-stack">
    <button class="dl-button" bind:tap="viewProfile">查看我的关系底图</button>
    <button class="dl-button dl-button--outline" bind:tap="goHome">返回首页</button>
  </view>
  <view class="success-note">未经双方同意，不会交换联系方式。你可以随时修改资料、暂停参与或删除档案。</view>
</view>
